            "paragraph": "Finally, given the superior performance of the ENSO-only correction scheme (Fig. S5), we employed Ni\u00f1o3.4 forecasts to develop a hybrid dynamic-statistical GMST prediction framework for real-time forecasts (Fig. 3). In this framework, the IAP ENSO EPS provides the dynamic prediction of Ni\u00f1o3.4, which is subsequently incorporated into the statistical correction module of the IAP GMST SEPS. This integration effectively links the dynamical ENSO evolution with the statistical GMST prediction system, thereby enabling operational real-time GMST forecasts.",
